OL,6, CONGRESS DEFIES YELTSIN BAN V "/=&
OL,7,F                           V
OL,8, Russia's Congress has held an emergency
OL,9, meeting in direct defiance of a ban by
OL,10, President Boris Yeltsin.
OL,12,FDeputy chairman Yuri Voronin said the
OL,13,Fmeeting had been called to discuss the
OL,14,Fformal impeachment of the president.
OL,15,F
OL,16,CFAlexander Rutskoi, who was elected
OL,17,Fpresident by the rebel parliament, has
OL,18,Fcalled for joint parliamentary and
OL,19,Fpresidential elections next year.
