OL,6, BLACKS GET GOVERNING ROLE  V  "/=&
OL,7,F                           V
OL,8, South African MPs have voted to give
OL,9, blacks a role in governing the country
OL,10, for the first time.
OL,12,FThe ruling National Party used its
OL,13,Fmajority to push through the power-
OL,14,Fsharing agreement with the African
OL,15,FNational Congresss and other groups.
OL,16,F
OL,17,FBlacks will sit on a Transitional
OL,18,FExecutive Council which will oversee
OL,19,Fthe run-up to multi-racial elections.
