OL,6, POLICE TO MEET OVER REFORMS    R (/q
OL,7,                                R ,'!$#!
OL,8, Police chiefs from 52 forces have been
OL,9, invited to a meeting by the Home
OL,10, Secretary to discuss the controversial
OL,11, Sheehy proposals on pay and conditions.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FThe Home Office meeting next week will
OL,14,Fbe the most comprehensive gathering of
OL,15,Fpolice representatives since the Sheehy
OL,16,Freport was published in June.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FPolice representatives said it would be
OL,19,Fa case of reaffirming opposition.
